WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.560
Choose the entry point that
matches today's constraints.

00:00:02.747 --> 00:00:06.480
If requirements are ready, start
with reviewed onboarding scenarios.

00:00:06.613 --> 00:00:10.320
If execution is repeatable,
test AI-assisted payment cases

00:00:10.373 --> 00:00:14.640
in the existing framework.
If useful diagnostics are available,

00:00:14.707 --> 00:00:17.200
trial an evidence-linked triage assistant.

00:00:17.376 --> 00:00:21.520
Each option has a concrete output
and a reviewer who can judge it.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:26.320
Begin with one, capture what works, and
use that evidence to decide the next step.
